  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/649/logo-png.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"烈焰劍標誌\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">讓「火焰附魔」顯示火焰特效</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmr-expence.github.io%252fprojects%252fflaming-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View the pack on my website!-black?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在我的網站上查看此資源包！\"></a><br>\n  <br>\n  <p>此資源包會在你為武器附魔「火焰」時，更換其材質。</p><p>若版本為 1.21.4 或更低，需要搭配 CIT 模組使用，因為 1.21.5 已原生支援自訂物品紋理。</p><p>銅劍與下界合金劍擁有不同的火焰顏色。</p><p>來自 tixul 的「附魔輪廓」的 3D 戰鎚與弓。</p><p>烈焰劍現在已支援 tixul 的 [附魔輪廓](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fglowing-glints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints</a>)</p><p>你可以使用 [ResPackOpts](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts</a>) 來切換資源包的各個部分。</p><p>如果沒有動畫，請嘗試在影片設定中關閉 `僅動畫化可見紋理`。</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/641/wooden_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"木劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/642/stone_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"石劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/643/copper_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"銅劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/644/iron_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"鐵劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/645/golden_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金劍\"><br><br><img src=\"http://elerium.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"鑽石劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/647/fire_mace-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"戰鎚\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/648/bow-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"弓\"><br>\n</div>",
